   "title": "How the pieces meet",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**You pick:** the four pieces from `seedvr2_4k_one_piece.json`, and your render for its sound. Needs KJNodes.\n\n## Only the overlaps are blended\n\nThe long parts are cut from each piece; where two pieces overlap, the new piece fades in over the old one: 9 frames, 18 at the last piece (it ends on the last frame).\n\n| part | frames of the take |\n|---|---|\n| piece 1 | 0-47 |\n| blend 1 → 2 | 48-56 |\n| piece 2 | 57-95 |\n| blend 2 → 3 | 96-104 |\n| piece 3 | 105-134 |\n| blend 3 → 4 | 135-152 |\n| piece 4 | 153-191 |\n\nConcatenate Video works one frame at a time, so the join needs a few GB of RAM.\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "**You pick:** the four pieces from `seedvr2_4k_one_piece.json`, and your render for its sound. Needs KJNodes.\n\n## Only the overlaps are blended\n\nThe long parts are cut from each piece; where two pieces overlap, the new piece fades in over the old one: 9 frames, 18 at the last piece (it ends on the last frame).\n\n| part | frames of the take |\n|---|---|\n| piece 1 | 0-47 |\n| blend 1 → 2 | 48-56 |\n| piece 2 | 57-95 |\n| blend 2 → 3 | 96-104 |\n| piece 3 | 105-134 |\n| blend 3 → 4 | 135-152 |\n| piece 4 | 153-191 |\n\nConcatenate Video works one frame at a time, so the join needs a few GB of RAM.\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
